# Simulation Progress Tracking File

# Column Details:
#   Step        : Simulation step number.
#   dT(s)       : Time elapsed for this specific step.
#   T(s)        : Total time since simulation start.
#   E(eV)       : Energy of the system.
#   Ea(eV)      : Activation energy barrier of the selected event.
#   Ref         : Index in the reference table of the selected event.
#   k_evt(ps-1) : Rate constant of the selected event.
#   k_tot(ps-1) : Total rate constant of all possible events at this step.
#   drmax(A)    : Maximum atomic displacement since the previous step.
#   drtot(A)    : Sum of displacements of atoms displaced by more than 0.05 A since the previous step.
#   Nmoved      : Number of atoms displaced by more than 0.05 A since the previous step.
#   dWall(s)    : Wall time of this step.
#   Wall(s)     : Total wall time since simulation start.
#   CPU(s)      : Total CPU time (Wall(s) x 8 CPUs).

